<% content_for :title, "Malagueña" %>

<div class="manifesto">
  <p class="eyebrow">The idea</p>
  <h1>Just play.</h1>

  <p class="manifesto-lead">
    Malagueña is the song that made me pick up and try the guitar again
    and I could not have picked a better name for a guitar app.
  </p>

  <p>
    This app holds all the tools for you to pick up the guitar again: a
    library of tab music, a guitar tuner, a metronome and daily practice
    routines.
  </p>

  <p class="manifesto-story">
    No sign-ups, upsells, subscriptions, ad breaks or popups.
  </p>

  <div class="toolbar manifesto-actions">
    <%= link_to "Tune up", tuner_path, class: "btn" %>
    <%= link_to "Start a routine", routines_path, class: "btn btn-ghost" %>
  </div>
</div>
